---
description: Synced files must not be edited
globs: "english/**,si.go,bigbytes.go,big.go"
alwaysApply: true
---

`english/`, `si.go`, `bigbytes.go` and `big.go` are generated by the upstream sync job. Do not
modify them under any circumstances; changes are lost on the next sync. Report problems in these
files instead of patching them.
